{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人陳曉華（Hera）與劉佩玥（Moon）出席無綫今日（9日）與騰訊音樂娛樂集團共同舉行戰略合作發布會，Hera雖然並非唱家班出身，但覺得有更大平台宣揚廣東歌實屬好事，自己今年亦多了登台唱歌的機會，問到會否想爭取《大灣區勁歌金曲頒獎典禮》的</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.815451+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T10:26:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:23.914634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:23.914634+00:00","content_hash":"56109788ce799a38600bbf139a646a93aed949f56bb34df1a3fe952ef6e7d4e6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}